      "reference": "```python\ndef run_length(s):\n    out = []\n    i = 0\n    while i < len(s):\n        j = i\n        while j < len(s) and s[j] == s[i]:\n            j += 1\n        out.append(s[i] + str(j - i))\n        i = j\n    return ''.join(out)\n```"
