      "reference": "```python\ndef charlie_cipher(s):\n    out = []\n    n = 0\n    for ch in s:\n        if ch.isascii() and ch.isalpha():\n            n += 1\n            base = ord('A') if ch.isupper() else ord('a')\n            out.append(chr((ord(ch) - base + n) % 26 + base))\n        else:\n            out.append(ch)\n    return ''.join(out)\n```"
